// Package testvectors is the shared password/hash test-vector pool used
// by gate (Stage 2) and loadgen (DESIGN.md sec 5, sec 7, sec 10): known
// password/hash pairs, both matching and deliberately mismatched, plus a
// gate-only negative set of well-formed hashes at non-exact parameters.
//
// internal/wrapper never imports this package: the gate Stage 1
// allowlist admits internal/classifier exactly, not its subpackages, so
// a mutant cannot answer /verify by table lookup instead of Argon2.
//
// vectors.json is generated by ./gen, which hashes through
// internal/hashcore. The committed file is the source of truth;
// regenerating it changes every salt and password.
package testvectors

//go:generate go run ./gen
